<title>USA: IPO FILING - NovAtel Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - NovAtel Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		     NovAtel Inc.</p>
<p> Stock symbol			   NGPSF.O</p>
<p> Estimated price range	     $10-12/shr</p>
<p> Total shares to be offered    2.57 million</p>
<p> Shrs offered by company	 2.2  million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  0.37 million</p>
<p> Shrs outstanding after ipo    7.4  million</p>
<p> Lead Underwriter     Montgomery Securities</p>
<p> Underwriters over-allotment   385,500 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Based in Calgary, Alberta, Canada, the company designs, markets and supports products that use global positioning system to determine precise geographic locations, principally for high-end market applications.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To retire debt, finance construction of a new corporate facility and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p> Financial Data in 000s:     1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		  $13,502	     $8,586</p>
<p>   - Net Income	    ($10,692)	   ($5,207)</p>
